We know what we're measuring.

c64b1ad2-6f37-4442-bb92-af495720d18e-0
00:26:39.160 --> 00:26:42.394
So fortunately,
with professional training,

c64b1ad2-6f37-4442-bb92-af495720d18e-1
00:26:42.394 --> 00:26:45.040
we don't have to reinvent the wheel.

ee61b658-098a-40c0-8ba9-a9f512fcc1de-0
00:26:46.600 --> 00:26:52.094
Training in multicultural care has grown
across behavioural health professions

ee61b658-098a-40c0-8ba9-a9f512fcc1de-1
00:26:52.094 --> 00:26:55.920
over several decades,
especially in graduate programs.

1da4f81e-355a-4481-8cfd-1264db739aa5-0
00:26:57.360 --> 00:27:01.879
Since 2002,
the APA Ethics Code with Standards 201

1da4f81e-355a-4481-8cfd-1264db739aa5-1
00:27:01.879 --> 00:27:05.955
A&amp;
B on boundaries of competence requires

1da4f81e-355a-4481-8cfd-1264db739aa5-2
00:27:05.955 --> 00:27:11.981
practitioners to work only within areas
of demonstrated competence,

1da4f81e-355a-4481-8cfd-1264db739aa5-3
00:27:11.981 --> 00:27:15.879
and that includes cultural competence
also.

f4aca736-a5fa-474d-8237-39e1f3822da9-0
00:27:15.880 --> 00:27:21.039
The APA multicultural Guidelines that
were adopted in 2017 extend this across

f4aca736-a5fa-474d-8237-39e1f3822da9-1
00:27:21.039 --> 00:27:24.280
all domains of practice,
research and education.

265b5ac4-e096-4561-8388-3b35b249d17d-0
00:27:27.080 --> 00:27:31.040
So these these can be adopted directly
into our program certification.

