00:27:32.640 --> 00:27:37.321
And here I'd like to say I'm sorry I
haven't managed to get to the training

8fd3a484-7756-4cae-9826-279cb5bb2bbd-1
00:27:37.321 --> 00:27:41.880
and education committees and I hope to be
